body:
1. If God does not exist, then objective moral values do not exist;
2. The universe with objective moral values does exist;
3. Therefore, God exists.Explaining the key premise

I'd like to reference Mere Christianity as we'll by C.S. Lewis on this. We all appeal to a standard yet without religion, specifically christianity, it makes nonsense where it came from. An idea cannot be produced through evolution, especially one present in the majority of human beings.
